    {
      "source": "<b>Note</b>: The <code>getThis()</code> method returns the current Spring AOP proxy.\nThe <code>getTarget()</code> method returns the current Spring AOP target (which may be\n<code>null</code> if there is no target instance) as a plain POJO without any advice.\n<b>If you want to call the object and have the advice take effect, use <code>getThis()</code>.</b>\nA common example is casting the object to an introduced interface in the implementation of\nan introduction. There is no such distinction between target and proxy in AspectJ itself.",
      "translation": "<b>注意</b>：<code>getThis()</code> 方法返回当前的 Spring AOP 代理。\n<code>getTarget()</code> 方法返回当前的 Spring AOP 目标对象（如果没有目标实例，则可能为 <code>null</code>），作为一个不带任何通知的普通 POJO。\n<b>如果您希望调用该对象并使通知生效，请使用 <code>getThis()</code>。</b>\n一个常见的例子是在引入的实现中将对象强制转换为引入接口。AspectJ 本身在目标和代理之间没有这种区分。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns the Spring AOP proxy. Cannot be <code>null</code>.",
      "translation": "返回 Spring AOP 代理。不能为<code>null</code>。",
